WEBVTT

00:04:29.765 --> 00:04:33.144
and something that would be
very exciting to the children.

00:04:33.185 --> 00:04:35.438
Something that somehow
would help these children

00:04:35.438 --> 00:04:38.232
forget about their hunger
and then engage with running.

00:04:38.274 --> 00:04:41.027
But also something that would help
teachers have control

00:04:41.068 --> 00:04:42.945
on overcrowded classrooms.

00:04:42.987 --> 00:04:44.405
But most importantly,

00:04:44.447 --> 00:04:48.451
help children engage with algebra,
with the science they were learning,

00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:51.579
and have fun every single day
they came to school.

00:04:52.079 --> 00:04:55.041
And so even though I had never
taken drawing classes,

00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:58.586
I picked up a pencil and got some courage
to start making sketches

00:04:58.586 --> 00:05:00.463
of what would be my first board game.